---
description: Unit and integration testing standards
globs: ["**/*.test.*", "**/*.spec.*", "**/test_*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Test behavior and edge cases, not implementation details.
- Always cover: (1) happy path, (2) invalid/boundary inputs, (3) state transition conflicts (e.g., cancelling an already delivered order), and (4) concurrency/idempotency edge cases.
- Keep tests fast, deterministic, and independent of external network calls.